<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/710079070%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Banjole Roman villa";
    rdfs:comment "A Roman maritime villa located at the southwest corner of the Istrian peninsula, about six kilometers south of Pola. According to Matijašić 1982, the remains of the villa are visible beneath the waters of Paltana Bay.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/710079070> .

