    rdfs:label "Zygris (Zawiet el-Chammas?)";
    rdfs:comment "An ancient town of the Zygritai on the ancient Libyan coast. Ptolemy provides the name and coordinates; BAtlDir tentatively associates it with modern Zawiet el-Chammas in Egypt's Matruh governorate.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/716657> .

