    rdfs:label "Marmara sanctuary";
    rdfs:comment "An ancient sanctuary, perhaps sacred to Demeter, that was discovered during tunneling for the Corinth to Patras highway. The terraced site is located at Marmara, SSE of Aigeira. It dates from the seventh century BCE to the third century BCE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/716756355> .

