<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/717610741%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Tempio di Grasceta dei Cavallari";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/971724591%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The temple of Grasceta dei Cavallari is an Etrusco-Roman sanctuary located in the municipality of Tolfa. This sanctuary sits at the foot of Mount Mazza, above a pass near Tarquinia and Caere's ancient borders. The temple was small, with a rectangular platform and an octastyle arrangement.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/717610741> .

