<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/719977882%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Bolʹshoĭ Petropavlovskiĭ burial ground";
    rdfs:comment "Burial complex along a stretch of over 3 km of the northern bank of the Siniukha River, a stream in the Laba River valley (Krasnodar region). The necropolis contains over 200 individual burials dated to the Middle Bronze-Early Iron Ages (3rd millennium BCE-3rd century CE).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/719977882> .

