    rdfs:label "Alhambra";
    rdfs:comment "Alhambra, Generalife, and Albayzín together form a UNESCO World Heritage Site that preserves elements of the medieval heritage of Granada, Spain. The Alhambra is a fortified palace complex that was begun by Muhammad I Ibn al-Ahmar, the first Nasrid emir and founder of the Emirate of Granada, in 1238.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/720436836> .

