    rdfs:label "Mycenaean cemetery at Aidonia";
    rdfs:comment "Mycenaean burial ground located approximately 8 kilometers west of Nemea containing 20 tombs dated to the 15th century BCE. All but two of the burials were looted in the 1970s, but the illicit finds were retrieved and repatriated to Greece in 1996.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/720628459> .

