<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/73644851%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Sanctuary of Apollo";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/570074%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The Sanctuary of Apollo near Amyklai is a stoa-like building that enclosed a colossal statue of Apollo on three sides and was decorated with reliefs. The tomb of Hyacinthus is used as a statue base, combining the two local deities together.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/73644851> .

