<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/743364991%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Shop with dwelling (VII.4.22)";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/599902893%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The ruins of VII.4.22 at Pompeii are identified as a shop with an associated dwelling and are linked to VII.4.21. The site was excavated in 1822 and again in 1833 and was bombed during the Second World War (13 September 1943). Among the themes depicted in the wall paintings of the structure are those to do with Adonis and his tomb at Byblos.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/743364991> .

