<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/746338295%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "villa del Cavalcavia di Salone";
    rdfs:comment "The so-called \"Villa of the Jurist\" was discovered in 2013 during salvage excavations connected with the expansion of Italy's A24 motorway. A significant villa of the Late Republican period was documented and attributed to the jurist Quintus Mucius Scaevola.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/746338295> .

