<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/757729509%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Unnamed settlement near Meğana, Algeria";
    rdfs:comment "Remains of a quarried ancient settlement of Roman date, recorded by Gsell (AAA, whence BAtlas). Gsell places it approximately 2 kilometers southeast of the village of \"Medjana\". The location should lie within a kilometer of the BAtlas coordinates: a point west of the modern RN 106 highway between Meğana and Bordj Bou Arreridj in the Algerian wilaya of Bordj Bou Arreridj.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/757729509> .

