<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/765943189%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Oostvoorne";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/109039%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Oostvoorne may correspond to a putative Roman period place that once protected the Meuse river estuary (Helinium) and therefore may have carried its name. Coastal change has long since consumed any remains of the Roman site; a Medieval castle is still attested.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/765943189> .

