<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/785376781%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Kassites";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/29816%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/912816%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Tribal people living in southwestern Asia, attested principally in Babylonia and western Iran during the second and first millennia B. C. The original homeland of the Kassites has yet to be identified, but it may have been located in the Zagros Mountains.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/785376781> .

