<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/786089%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Philae";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/222740561%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/463803480%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An ancient island located just above the First cataract of the Nile River that was flooded by the construction of the Aswan High Dam. The island was home to a multi-period temple complex, which was moved to the nearby island of Agilkia and declared a UNESCO World Heritage Site in the 1970s.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/786089> .

