    rdfs:comment "A Roman villa associated with a Caius Furius Octavianus who was a member of the Senatorial order during the Severan period. The villa was identified along the via Aurelia in the locality of Massimina - Casal Lumbroso. Excavations were carried out between 2011 and 2017.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/786809029> .

