    rdfs:label "Qaziqulu necropolis";
    rdfs:comment "Burial ground near the village of Qaziqulu in Azerbaijan's Tovuz district. The site contains a number of burials dated from the 10th-7th centuries BCE. The site was inundated during the construction of the Tovuzchay reservoir in 2016.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/790295319> .

