    rdfs:label "Adriatic Veneti";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/393374%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The \"Adriatic Veneti\" were an ancient Indo-European people dwelling in northeastern Italy. Their initial territory corresponds to the area between Lake Garda and the Euganean Hills. They eventually occupied much of what is now the Veneto region.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/792893804> .

