<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707579%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Melabron?";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707498%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A Hellenistic-and-Roman-era site, sometimes locally referred to as Palaiokastro, on the northwest coast of Cyprus, west of the modern village of Ag. Eirini. Archaeological investigation also produced evidence of Bronze Age habitation here. The historical site is possibly to be identified with the attested name Melabron.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707579> .

