        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/848646653%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The legendary birthplace of the goddess Aphrodite, (Nea) Paphos has been a center of activity since the Final Bronze Age when Mycenaeans honored the goddess there. The site was listed on the UNESCO World Heritage List in 1980.";
