    rdfs:comment "The church of Panagia tis Angeloktistis or Panagia Angeloktisti is a Byzantine church located in the village of Kiti, Cyprus. Its origins lies in the fifth and sixth centuries. It was listed as a tentative UNESCO World Heritage site in 2015.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707599> .

