<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707642%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Vouni";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707498%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Vouni is located on the northwest coast of Cyprus, some 7 km west of Soloi. The rocky hill was occupied in antiquity and the settlement included a fortified palace enclosure, the ancient name of which is unknown. According to PECS, the palace is to be dated ca. 500 to 380 BCE, with two main architectural phases (I: ca. 500 to 450 BCE, II: ca. 450 to 380 BCE).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/707642> .

