    rdfs:comment "The Porticus Vipsania was a public complex located along the eastern side of the via Lata in the Campus Martius. This complex contained a map commissioned by Agrippa. The project was begun under Polla (Agrippa's sister) and completed under Augustus.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/721487826> .

