<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/728141243> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/vocab#Place>;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Ceylan 2017 p. 144",
        "Kleiss 1976 E 3 No. 65 (p. 15)",
        "Salvini 2008 p. 229-230",
        "eCUT CTU I A 5-041 (Q006939)",
