    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "Avatha (al-Bakhra') is the site of a Late Roman and early Islamic fort that is located south of Palmyra. The fort was originally a Tetrarchic establishment that housed an auxiliary cavalry unit. The fort was modified and expanded during the Umayyad period.";
