    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "The brick core of an arch monument stands immediately to the west of the Temple of Jupiter in the Forum of Pompeii. It has had various appellations including \"Arch of Drusus\", referring to Drusus Iulius Caesar the son of emperor Tiberius.";
