    rdfs:comment "4 clay tablets were found in dA6IV in a private house. These tablets were found near House 12 (Assur Archive 33) and House 9 (Assur Archive 32). The archive dates to the 7th century BC. The group consists of 2 loan documents concerning silver, a list of oxen and textiles, and a purchase document concerning a slave.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/739392374> .

